2026-10-14T21:12:30.1533393Z   WP-B: Unified Action and Scope Model
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1533794Z     1. Unified Action and Resource Policy Resolver (actionPolicyService)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1534545Z       ✓ Super Admin can manage any user and any lab (1 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1535016Z       ✓ Lab Manager can manage subordinate in own lab, but not in another lab (1 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1535789Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot manage peer manager or project manager
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1536315Z       ✓ Lab Manager cannot elevate technician to manager role (1 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1536799Z       ✓ Self-role change is rejected with SELF_MANAGEMENT_FORBIDDEN
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1537209Z       ✓ Inactive actor is denied with ACTOR_INACTIVE
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1537641Z     2. Project-to-Lab Canonical Membership Resolver (projectMembershipService)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1538167Z       ✓ resolveProjectLabs correctly identifies owner and servicing laboratories (2 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1538744Z       ✓ getDiscrepancyReport scans database and returns audit report without data loss (4 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1539331Z       ✓ canManageProject allows owner lab manager and super admin; denies non-owner manager
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1539816Z     3. Assignable Roles Server Catalogue (GET /api/access/assignable-roles)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1540313Z       ✓ Super Admin gets all 10 roles in assignableRoles (8 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1541095Z       ✓ Lab Manager gets only ALLOWED_SUB_ROLES and sees peer/admin roles as unmanageable with reasons (8 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1541800Z       ✓ Ordinary viewer is denied access to assignable-roles (403 Forbidden) (11 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1542490Z       ✓ GET /api/access/capabilities returns platform role capabilities (6 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1542951Z     4. Work Assignment Eligibility & Validation (A23, LG-17, A33)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1543538Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to deactivated technician is rejected with ASSIGNEE_INACTIVE (400) (50 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1544190Z       ✓ A23: Assignment to technician in different lab is rejected with 403 (10 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1544810Z       ✓ A23: Assignment in paused/inactive lab is rejected with LAB_PAUSED (400) (14 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1545498Z       ✓ GET /api/work/eligible-assignees returns active analytical staff and excludes deactivated staff (8 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1546062Z     5. Staff Directory Scoping & Bounded Pagination (LG-08, LG-22)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1546639Z       ✓ LG-08: National user directory is strictly scoped to labs in authorized country (6 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1547268Z       ✓ LG-08: National user with empty country scope receives empty array (not global leak) (3 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1547900Z       ✓ GET /api/users/directory?purpose=assignment filters to active analytical staff (4 ms)
2026-10-14T21:12:30.1548568Z       ✓ GET /api/users enforces bounded pagination (clamps excessive limit to 100) and excludes password (6 ms)
